
| Command   | Purpose                | Example              |
| --------- | ---------------------- | -------------------- |
| `man`     | Detailed manual        | `man ls`             |
| `--help`  | Quick command help     | `ls --help`          |
| `help`    | Bash built-in help     | `help cd`            |
| `type`    | Identify command type  | `type cd`            |
| `which`   | Find executable path   | `which python`       |
| `whereis` | Find binary/man/source | `whereis ls`         |
| `apropos` | Find commands by topic | `apropos permission` |
